The Madonna revision pass is finished: the one open gate item (P0-03, in two FAQ answers) is fixed, lint is clean (0 fail), and the resolution artifact passes the pipeline's resolution gate. The page is still over the length band at 4,410 words (was 4,436), because most of the cuts the grader asked for are passages the perspective jury protected.

**What triggered the loop:** perspective verification failed on P0-03, and the grade came back B (8.4).

